flowchart TD
    U[User describes music in browser or CLI] --> I[Validate request length and text]
    I --> P[Task-specific prompt plus represented genre vocabulary and JSON schema]
    P --> G[Gemini REST client: one request, timeout, no retries]
    P --> X[Explicit offline mode: predefined test fixture]
    G --> V[Validate response structure, numeric values, genre labels and contradictions]
    X --> V
    V --> B[Check known unsupported guarantees]
    B --> H[Human reviews or edits preferences in browser; CLI explicit confirmation]
    M[Manual preferences, no provider required] --> H
    H --> F[Filter required genres, exclusions, bounds and missing evidence]
    D[Versioned FMA catalog] --> V
    D --> F
    F --> R[Deterministic weighted ranking over requested preferences]
    R --> O[Real tracks with factual explanations, compromises and source references]
    G --> E[Safe categorized provider error; manual mode remains available]
    V --> E
    B --> C[Unsupported conditions require clarification or explicit revision]
    C --> H
    F --> N[No suitable results; conditions are not relaxed]
    R --> N
    T[Pytest, UI tests and running-app checks] -.-> V
    T -.-> H
    T -.-> F
    Q[Evaluation harness: predefined requests, pass/fail summary, JSON results] -.-> I
    Q -.-> O
    Q -.-> A[Live generic-vs-specialized comparison uses same model, schema, vocabulary and requests]
    A -.-> P
